"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2114980765062607191\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2114980765062607191.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Short-term holders have shifted from taking profits to realising losses, and the 24-hour exchange inflow balance has turned negative.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2114980765062607191\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 27</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2114980765062607191\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
